      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "I have the same problem with the same error message. \nThe error:\n\n> llama-cli: /root/BitNet/3rdparty/llama.cpp/ggml/src/ggml.c:14652: void ggml_compute_forward_soft_max_f32(const struct ggml_compute_params *, struct ggml_tensor *): Assertion `!isnan(wp[i])' failed.`\n> \n> llama-cli: /root/BitNet/3rdparty/llama.cpp/ggml/src/ggml.c:14652: void ggml_compute_forward_soft_max_f32(const struct ggml_compute_params *, struct ggml_tensor *): Assertion `!isnan(wp[i])' failed.\n> \n> Error occurred while running command: Command '['build/bin/llama-cli', '-m', 'models/BitNet-b1.58-2B-4T/ggml-model-i2_s.gguf', '-n', '128', '-t', '2', '-p', 'You are a helpful assistant', '-ngl', '0', '-ub', '16', '-c', '2048', '--temp', '0.8', '-b', '1', '-cnv']' died with <Signals.SIGABRT: 6>.\n\nWhile running this command:\n`python run_inference.py -m models/BitNet-b1.58-2B-4T/ggml-model-i2_s.gguf -p \"You are a helpful assistant\" -cnv`\n\nI've already added _-ub=16_ to the command in run_inference.py. The _-cb_ seems to be not accepted at all. \n\nRunning as VM in Rocky9 with CPU set to 12vCPUs of Xeon E5-2450v2.\n\n",
